WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,090 --> 00:00:03,990
Wait

2
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:08,290
Then it was also because you kicked that guy's bathroom door lock into pieces before.

3
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:11,930
If they were willing to listen to advice and change rooms, they could still survive.

4
00:00:12,550 --> 00:00:13,630
If you don't listen to advice

5
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,340
Your things will come out of the bathroom

6
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:25,940
Kill everyone in the room, Brother Wang

7
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:29,130
What do you think the person named Su is?

8
00:00:30,810 --> 00:00:31,890
What could it be?

9
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:34,330
Just a lucky nouveau riche

10
00:00:35,790 --> 00:00:37,940
What he said will make people shut up.

11
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:42,010
Just believe whatever he says and don’t talk nonsense to me.
